 545:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** *  BLE interrupt notifications feature enables via define in cy_ble_config.h:
 546:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** *  \code
